  "body": "Get up to 6 RESET on OpenDesign 🎉\n\nInvite a friend to OpenDesign. When they sign up through your link and start their first paid subscription within 48 hours, you each receive a Reset Card if eligible. Use it to reset your Design Plan usage limits.\n\n> 📥 **Download:** Find desktop installers on [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design/releases).\n\n## 🔥 Highlights\n\n- **🎉 Invite friends, earn together.** Invite a friend to subscribe and both of you receive a Reset Card. A simple invitation turns into a shared boost for the next thing you make.\n- **💡 Start creating from \\$8.** Your first month starts at \\$8, with up to \\$220 in DeepSeek usage to help you keep experimenting.\n- **🎬 Make more in one place.** Turn ideas into motion videos, design work, and slides without leaving OpenDesign.\n",
